 center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; margin-right: 10px; background: transparent; border: none;\">[Star]</div>\n                        <div class=\"checkered\" style=\"flex-grow: 1;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div style=\"text-align: right; color: #fff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -2px;\">← ←</div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"text-lines\" style=\"font-size: 15px; margin-top: auto;\">\n                        <div style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 10px;\">\n                            公众号每期的 <span style=\"background-color: #6B5AE1; color: #fff; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; display: inline-block;\">「次条福利文」</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"padding-left: 10px;\">都向家人们抛出了各种</div>\n                        <div style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 20%;\">热议的话题</div>\n                        <div style=\"padding-left: 10px;\">送出了一轮又一轮的奖励</div>\n                        <div style=\"text-align: center;\">而“侃侃而谈”和“开店风云”</div>\n                        <div style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 20%;\">两大征稿专栏</div>\n                        <div style=\"padding-left: 10%;\">将在本期</div>\n                        <div style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 20%;\">与大家做个正式的告别</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
